{"id":"d8548b49e60e0239","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers.md","title":"Definition — 层子对象的逆像与存在、全称量词","display":"Definition — 层子对象的逆像与存在、全称量词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers","aliases":["14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers"],"display":"Definition — 层子对象的逆像与存在、全称量词","source_ref":"III.8, pp.146–149","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 层子对象的逆像与存在、全称量词"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"III.8, pp.146–149"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"005f78978592c0bb\" href=\"?note=005f78978592c0bb\" title=\"14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations\">14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:E\\to F\">\\(f:E\\to F\\)</span> 为层态射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq E\">\\(A\\subseteq E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq F\">\\(B\\subseteq F\\)</span> 为子层。以下子对象都以子函子表示，并继承对应层的限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}(B)(C):=\\{x\\in E(C)\\mid f_C(x)\\in B(C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^{-1}(B)(C):=\\{x\\in E(C)\\mid f_C(x)\\in B(C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\exists_fA)(C):=\\left\\{y\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\{u\\in\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\exists x\\in A(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\ f_{\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u)}(x)=F(u)(y)\\}\\in J(C)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\exists_fA)(C):=\\left\\{y\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\{u\\in\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\exists x\\in A(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\ f_{\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u)}(x)=F(u)(y)\\}\\in J(C)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall_fA)(C):=\\left\\{y\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ \\forall x\\in E(D)\\ (f_D(x)=F(u)(y)\\Rightarrow x\\in A(D))\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall_fA)(C):=\\left\\{y\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ \\forall x\\in E(D)\\ (f_D(x)=F(u)(y)\\Rightarrow x\\in A(D))\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}(B)(u):=(f^{-1}(B)(C),f^{-1}(B)(D),(x\\mapsto E(u)(x)))\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^{-1}(B)(u):=(f^{-1}(B)(C),f^{-1}(B)(D),(x\\mapsto E(u)(x)))\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(y\\mapsto F(u)(y)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\{\\exists_fA,\\forall_fA\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(y\\mapsto F(u)(y)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\{\\exists_fA,\\forall_fA\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在量词是逐点像在覆盖下的闭包；全称量词必须检查所有进一步限制中的原像，仅检查 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E(C)\">\\(E(C)\\)</span> 会遗漏局部出现的见证。这些赋值对限制稳定，覆盖局部封闭的核对依次使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 的层条件和覆盖稳定、传递性，故给出子层。在后继原子中直接验证两条伴随关系，因而无需把量词当成未定义原语。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，III.8, pp.146–149。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"005f78978592c0bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-lattice-operations]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"f:E\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}(B)(C):=\\{x\\in E(C)\\mid f_C(x)\\in B(C)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\exists_fA)(C):=\\left\\{y\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\{u\\in\\operatorname{MaxSieve}_{\\mathcal C}(C)\\mid\\exists x\\in A(\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u))\\ f_{\\operatorname{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(u)}(x)=F(u)(y)\\}\\in J(C)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\forall_fA)(C):=\\left\\{y\\in F(C)\\ \\middle|\\ \\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\ \\forall x\\in E(D)\\ (f_D(x)=F(u)(y)\\Rightarrow x\\in A(D))\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"f^{-1}(B)(u):=(f^{-1}(B)(C),f^{-1}(B)(D),(x\\mapsto E(u)(x)))\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)).","display":true},{"tex":"K(u):=(K(C),K(D),(y\\mapsto F(u)(y)))\\quad\\left(K\\in\\{\\exists_fA,\\forall_fA\\},\\ u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"E(C)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false}],"bytes":2108,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers|df-203 — 层子对象的逆像与存在、全称量词]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers|df-203 — 层子对象的逆像与存在、全称量词]]"},{"id":"28cb695aaa176c37","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:E\\to F$ 为小站点上的层态射，$A\\subseteq E$、$B\\subseteq F$ 为子层。$f^{-1},\\exists_f,\\forall_f$ 为 [[14-df-subsheaf-quantifiers]] 的构造，子层次序为逐点包含，$\\wedge$ 为逐点交。"}],"outgoing":["005f78978592c0bb"]}